  Header: 'Custodian''s handbook: Portable Fabricator'
  Body: The Portable Fabricator (PF) is the Architects' latest solution for efficient
    navigation of the Tower. By streamlining the production of ropes and torches,
    custodians are now able to access secluded structures while retaining close to
    perfect visibility, without the need to resupply at equipment centers.
  IsDiscovered: 1
